+
+## Coupled-run status ownership
+
+`src/coupled_status.rs` owns the read-only projection of native multi-iteration records. It reads `iterations.json` and durable `state/tui-work.json` ledgers but does not add or change persistence. Durable request accounting remains owned by the native WorkBudget ledger: wire usage counts every ledger request, while task usage counts task-charged requests and applies the native default when `charge` is omitted. Unknown usage in an interrupted pending ledger is represented as `null`, not zero. The coupled-status command reports recorded manifest completion only; it is not an independent verification or promotion authority.
